 "description": "List the countries, ID formats and official sources Fuentio covers. Free, no key.\nUse it first when unsure whether a country or ID format is supported, or to explain coverage. Don't use it to check a company: call lookup_company or search_companies.\nInputs: none. Example: list_coverage().\nReturns: per country, status (available or planned), coverage level, ID formats with real examples and whether lookup works, regional registers, and sources with licence and update frequency.\nLimits: 0 units. Read-only. Covered today: France, Spain and United Kingdom.\nSearch words: company registry, KYB, SIREN, RCS, Annuaire des Entreprises, soci\u00e9t\u00e9; BORME, Registro Mercantil, empresa, sociedad; Companies House, company number, Ltd, plc, LLP.",
